prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids. On that middle, October to November ran 49% of normal in 2025 and September to October ran 52% in 2025. So far in 2026, May to June came in at 64% of normal and June to July at 69%. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, from 55% on grid 30760 to 69% on grid 31059.</p>"}
